# 🔄 8. Compliance Remediation Workflow (Best Practice)

1. Identify non-compliance reason  
2. Sync device  
3. Apply required fix  
4. Re-sync  
5. Validate compliance in Intune  
6. Validate access in Entra ID  
7. Document remediation  
8. Educate user  

